taxAmt": 2873.39, "penaltyInterest": 1853.91, "total": 4727.3}]',replace('# ACQUISITION INTELLIGENCE MEMO\n**PC Peak Development | Internal Use Only**\n**Case:** TX-26-01190 | **Property:** 6406 Kemrock Dr., Dallas, TX 75241\n**Prepared By:** Acquisitions Analytics Desk | **Date:** June 2026\n**Distress Score:** 8/10 — CRITICAL\n\n---\n\n## ¶1 — PROPERTY & OWNER SITUATION\n\nThis is unambiguously a **land play, not a structure play.** The improvement at 6406 Kemrock Dr. is a 484-square-foot structure built in 1935 — 91 years old — carrying a 50% depreciation load per DCAD''s own assessment model. At that depreciation level on a sub-500 sqft footprint, the structure has effectively reached the end of its economic utility. DCAD has pegged total market value at **$120,340**, and given the age and size of the improvement, the overwhelming majority of that value is sitting in the dirt, not the building. The Carver Heights Addition parcel (Block 19/6890, South 57.15 Feet of Lot 9) is located in Dallas 75241 — a ZIP code with active infill redevelopment pressure from southern Dallas corridor investment activity. The structure presents with no homestead exemption on file, confirming what the condition data already suggests: **nobody is living there, and nobody is actively managing this asset.**\n\nOwnership transferred via Warranty Deed on **5/22/2018** (Instrument No. 201800135764), splitting title 50/50 between **Guadalupe Pichardo** and **Luden Ismael Osorto**. Pichardo''s address of record *is* the subject property — 6406 Kemrock Dr. — which is notable because it suggests either she listed it as her address at time of acquisition and has since vacated, or she never occupied it at all. Osorto''s address of record is **1821 Danbury Dr., Garland, TX 75040**, a separate residential address, indicating he is almost certainly not residing at the subject. The prior payment history ties to **Larry B. Jackson** and **Yvonne Jackson** (6224 Teague Dr., Dallas, TX 75241), who paid taxes in 2012, 2013, and 2016 — then went silent. The Jacksons appear in this suit as **In Rem Only** defendants, meaning they hold no personal liability but retain some residual deed interest that required joinder. The 2018 deed transfer from the Jackson-era ownership chain to P','\n',char(10)),NULL,'pre_judgment',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-07T22:59:59.652004','2026-07-09 05:04:54','2026-07-08T20:45:37.262641',1,'individual','high','Being Block 19/6890, South 57.15 Feet of Lot 9, of Carver Heights Addition, an addition in the City of Dallas, Dallas County, Texas, as shown by the Warranty Deed recorded as Instrument Number 201800135764 of the Deed Records of Dallas County, Texas','{"account_number": "00000643441000000", "market_value": 120340, "land_value": 70000, "improvement_value": 50340, "estimated_annual_taxes": 2679.62, "year_built": 1935, "effective_year_built": 1935, "actual_age": 91, "building_class": "04", "construction_type": "FRAME", "foundation": "POST", "roof_type": "", "roof_material": "", "exterior_wall": "", "living_area_sqft": 484, "total_area_sqft": 484, "bedrooms": 2, "bathrooms": "", "stories": "", "depreciation_pct": 50, "desirability": "AVERAGE", "air_condition": "WINDOW", "heating": "", "garage_sqft": null, "zoning": "SINGLE FAMILY 5K SQFT", "lot_frontage_ft": 57, "lot_depth_ft": 125, "lot_area_sqft": 7233.0, "land_unit_price": 70000.0, "legal_description": "1: CARVER HEIGHTS 2: BLK 19/6890 S 57.15 FT LT 9 3: 4: INT201800135764 DD07082016 CO-DC 5: 6890 019 00900 2006890 019 Deed Transfer Date: 5/22/2018", "owners": [{"name": "PICHARDO GUADALUPE", "pct": 50}, {"name": "OSORTO LUDEN ISMAEL &", "pct": 50}], "deed_transfer_date": "5/22/2018", "exemptions": "None", "no_homestead": true, "tax_rates": [], "current_tax_balance": 15690.92, "current_levy": 2321.8, "prior_year_due": 12403.25, "payment_history": [{"date": "2018-05-11", "amount": 1300.0, "tax_year": "2012, 2013, 2016", "payer": "JACKSON L B"}, {"date": "2018-03-09", "amount": 590.73, "